<p class="small muted">Polished tiger's eye and nephrite jade are safe: their fibres are locked in quartz or dense jade. Uranium glass is man-made and also appears in <a href="/uv-reactive/">UV Reactive</a>. This is general safety information, not medical advice. Each stone's page links its sources.</p>
